ecause the Landlord is guaranteed to pass on the pair of Aces. This ensures my teammate wins the trick. If my teammate\'s remaining two cards are a pair, we win the game immediately. If they are holding singles, they will play one next, and I can use my strong hand (222, Black Joker) to cover them or take control then. Playing my pair of 2s now would be a mistake as it risks blocking a potential immediate win and wastes my high control cards unnecessarily.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
